# Lab 5: Performance
@host = https://localhost:7001
@ticketId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@dana = paste-dana-token-here

### Page 1 of 4. Look at the X-Total-Count and Link headers.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tickets?page=1&pageSize=4
Authorization: Bearer {{dana}}

### Page 2
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tickets?page=2&pageSize=4
Authorization: Bearer {{dana}}

### Filtered: open, high priority
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tickets?status=Open&priority=High
Authorization: Bearer {{dana}}

### Too big a page: 400
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tickets?pageSize=500
Authorization: Bearer {{dana}}

### Read a ticket. Copy its ETag header for the next two requests.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{dana}}

### Unchanged since you last read it: 304, no body
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{dana}}
If-None-Match: "paste-etag-here"

### Update only if nobody else changed it (412 if they did)
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{dana}}
If-Match: "paste-etag-here"
Content-Type: application/json

{ "priority": "Urgent" }

### Make the store slow, then read a ticket twice: slow, then fast
PUT {{host}}/dev/chaos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "latencyMs": 800, "errorRate": 0, "available": true }

### Take the store down. A cached ticket still reads fine; the list doesn't.
PUT {{host}}/dev/chaos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "latencyMs": 0, "errorRate": 0, "available": false }

### Back to normal
POST {{host}}/dev/chaos/reset
